      <Placemark>
        <name>Camp 25, Chongjin
North Hamgyong Province</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AAjQbR6DMVEuD01adyLb9q3B55w9A1choWBUn00GeeqacljjCsIDdsQfx6Ceo9WewROY2fZjuNpD8AAm723rJjpiq_yYl5wgNxPevY592571s6yk6zxajlj-Fs7zP1QpkYsOui2TYlkqgLzF7aLAAGe5wwcZ2t7HxM5yc5Bjg6H2xV_yXGog_DB-b-4l6udW9lRM1YOLNqpBva1Al3c?fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Chongjin, North Hamgyong Province, 41.83299, 129.72106<br><br>Estimated # of Prisoners: 5,000<br><br>Type of prisoners: Political prisoners<br><br>Type of Labor: Bicycle manufacturing<br><br>Detailed analysis of Camp 25, Chongjin can be found in this 2015 HRNK report: https://www.hrnk.org/uploads/pdfs/ASA_HRNK_Camp25_Update2.pdf]]></description>
