      <Placemark>
        <name>Camp 16, Hwasong
North Hamgyong Province</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AAjQbR6WdgRihOfnEI2eX56HfdW-C2d-UPI5OI7Z2dolZGfKg_9bxmJ5TtoS8-zE5vjvHNgks9_4_x86XbSk_xYri1dlXB5WtOMcd2E8ky88NLimizZikTXDdI9WkTLwRC6mRqGDq7Vlr7JIZEV0y7HeMpQLPOrBnAX3LQeDsfSXkTlE9sTQeUx_5DKaA2gkeu7LPZf3wy08oZR5TlM?fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Hwasong, North Hamgyong Province, 41.28696, 129.26839.<br><br>Estimated # of Prisoners: 20,000<br><br>Type of prisoners: Political prisoners<br><br>Type of Labor: Mining, forestry, farming<br><br>Detailed analysis of Camp 16, Hwasong can be found in this 2015 HRNK report: https://www.hrnk.org/uploads/pdfs/ASA_HRNK_Camp16_v8_fullres_FINAL_12_15_15.pdf]]></description>
